

	•	Points multiplier: double loyalty points during holidays or new exhibit launches.
	•	Return-visit voucher: completed visit → auto-issue a "come back within 30 days" pass.
	•	Milestone reward: 5th visit this year → free annual-pass upgrade trial.

Operations and goodwill

	•	Service recovery: an exhibit closed or an event cancelled → affected bookings get a free re-entry automatically.
	•	Group logistics: 15+ tickets → a free group coordinator or a reserved entry slot.
	•	Launch promotion: a new amenity in its first 2 weeks is added free to boost awareness.

Implementation idea: most of these need a new action type alongside your discount actions, such as ADD_FREE_ITEM, UPGRADE, AWARD_POINTS, ISSUE_VOUCHER, or GRANT_PERK. The WHEN side reuses what you already have (cart totals, ticket titles, quantities, categories), plus context facts like visit date/time, customer profile, and weather.
